  "limitations": [
    "All imports/product execution/tests/build/typecheck/inference and photographic/numerical acceptance remain UNRUN.",
    "Explicit manual waist markers and contour/ownership review are required; Pose33 does not measure waist endpoints. No automatic instance segmentation or 3D body reconstruction.",
    "Upright visible bounded poses only; hidden, cropped, strongly bent, contacting or ambiguous anatomy refuses. Human marker accuracy and background/garment quality remain unverified.",
    "Arms crossing the marked waist follow local deformation, not a rigid-arm promise. Upper trunk/head above marked upper waist translate; lower waist/hips remain fixed.",
    "End-user per-target waist preset/batch transfer is not registered. Private helper is not that route. Existing torso transfer is unchanged.",
    "Existing original/derived opacity and HDR restrictions remain; no clipping/flattening to imply support."
  ],
